  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "每局重连 2,000 个星区，并让五区域经济随供需、距离、矿难和禁运变化，同时每 2,000 回合进入新纪元。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "▸ 2,000 sectors, procedurally rewired every run. No two galaxies are the same. ▸ A five-zone economy that reacts to supply, demand, distance, and sudden shocks like mining collapses and tech embargoes. ▸ Epoch shifts every 2,000 turns: pirate uprisings, trade booms, and faction wars across six eras before the Final Epoch locks in.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4382310/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "商人、战士、探索者、外交家与殖民者五条职业路径分别对应独立终局目标。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "FIVE PATHS. FIVE ENDGAMES. ▸ Trader, navigate and dominate the galactic market. ▸ Warrior, wiping the scourge of pirates from the map. ▸ Explorer, the map filled corner to corner. ▸ Diplomat, every great power calling you ally. ▸ Settler, a frontier stitched with your colonies.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4382310/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "八套可调 CRT 预设与可定制界面，可在七十年代终端到九十年代特效显示之间塑造复古科幻观感。",
      "dimension": "画风",
      "excerpt": "▸ Eight customizable CRT presets, with fine tunable settings that can make the game a crisp flat panel to a full retro burn pixellated vintage throwback. ▸ Customizable UI to make it as spartan as a '70s terminal to a glorious '90s effects display.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4382310/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
